    {
      "id": "rung_main_1d614704-3e81-4669-9559-4cf0f77d0d43",
      "comment": "Group_Counter (CTU): counts the rising edges of Bottle_Counted (the edge detection is inside the CTU, a bottle standing at the sensor counts once). Q = CV >= PackSize (6) -> Group_Complete closes the gate in the same scan. CV -> GroupCount for the HMI. Reset in RETRACT, i.e. only after the group arrived on the wrap conveyor (Pusher_Out): a group stopped halfway is still complete after a restart and is pushed again (rule 3)",
      "defaultBounds": [
        300,
        100
      ],
      "reactFlowViewport": [
        629,
        174
      ],
