    {
      "id": "rung_main_ae826a07-9b44-4f1a-87b7-ad4256cbf347",
      "comment": "Sheet_Waiting = Film_In_Slot AND Feed_Zero: a sheet is in the slot and nothing is being fed, so it was already cut (Stop in READY). WAIT_PACK then goes to READY directly, never a second sheet on top. Film_In_Slot with FeedCount > 0 = feed interrupted -> FEED the rest (rule 4 table)",
