      "id": "rung_main_f29e5e9d-b40f-4410-a22f-46151e77de7a",
      "comment": "SECTION 6 SEQUENCER TRANSITIONS. Abort, Start of both sequencers, then each transition as Seq_Enable AND step bit AND condition -> MOVE next step. The step bits were decoded at the top of the scan, so one sequencer moves at most one step per scan. (Header rung, no logic)",
